  - 'RCON (lines 40-43): redeclare as ''localparam logic [7:0] RCON [0:9]'' with values
    ''{8''h01,8''h02,8''h04,8''h08,8''h10,8''h20,8''h40,8''h80,8''h1b,8''h36}'' so
    that RCON[r] with r=round (0..9) supplies Rcon 1..10 (fixes the wrong 0x03/0x81
    values and the out-of-bounds RCON[0] read).'
  - 'gm2 (line 51): fix the reduction polynomial to the AES constant: gm2 = {a[6:0],1''b0}
    ^ (8''h1b & {8{a[7]}}).'
  - 'gm3 (line 55): fix to gm3 = gm2(a) ^ a (currently gm2(a)^gm2(a) makes gm3 always
